---
title: Westmuir Trust and Village Hall
description: Welscome to Westmuir Trust and Village Hall
headerImage: "/woodland/walkway-1980.avif"
headerAlt: "woodland walkway"
---

<h1>Westmuir Welcomes You!</h1>

<h2>About Us</h2>
<p>
  We are the Westmuir Community Development Trust that looks after the communal
  areas in the Village &amp; set up this welcome leaflet to provide key info
  that might be helpful for anyone newly arrived to Westmuir!
</p>

<div class="side-by-side">
  <div class="green-circle-badge">
    <div class="circle-line top-accent">westmuir.org.uk</div>
    <div class="circle-line middle-sub">&amp; facebook page -</div>
    <div class="circle-line main-title">Westmuir Village Life</div>
    <div class="circle-line bottom-text">has more information</div>
    <div class="circle-line bottom-sub">about what's going on!</div>
  </div>

  <div class="highlight-block">
    <p>In Westmuir we have:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Village Hall for events</li>
      <li>Award winning Community Woodland</li>
      <li>Path Network Walks</li>
      <li>Village Garden Centre</li>
      <li>Post Office</li>
      <li>Defibrillator in the Phone Box</li>
    </ul>

    <p>In Kirriemuir you can find:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Health Centre</li>
      <li>Dental Practice</li>
      <li>2 Pharmacies</li>
      <li>Thrums Vets</li>
      <li>Library</li>
      <li>Lots of local shops that need our support</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</div>
<editorial-block>
  <p>
    If you are interested in making a difference in your new community, we would
    love to hear from you! All different types of skills are needed - please get
    in touch!
  </p>

  <img
    slot="image"
    src="/wcdt/woodland-logo.png"
    alt="Woodland logo"
    width="800"
    sizes="(min-width: 50rem) 35ch, 90vw"
  />
</editorial-block>

<!-- Right Side Elements -->

<p>
  <a href="mailto:trust@westmuir.org.uk">trust@westmuir.org.uk</a>
</p>

